problem it solves and what stays impossible without it. Link its entry in
`docs/domain-map.md`. Tracking issue: https://github.com/notacamp/campbooks-cloud/issues/0.

## What Changes

- New module `demo_notes`, scaffolded by `cargo xtask new-module demo_notes`: crate
