## Context

TODO(new-module): what exists today and what this module builds on.

## Data ownership and events

- Schema: `demo_notes`, owned by this module alone. TODO(new-module): its
  tables, each with `workspace_id` and row-level security.
- Events published: none yet. TODO(new-module): each `demo_notes.<event>` with
